== month
1) Stop for the month once it is up $150
   trade   +60.00  month   +60.00  high     0.00  -> keep trading
   trade   +50.00  month  +110.00  high     0.00  -> keep trading
   trade   +45.00  month  +155.00  high     0.00  -> STOP for the month
   new month -> trading again
2) Lock profit once the month is up $500, lock 20% of the high
   trade  +300.00  month  +300.00  high   300.00  -> keep trading
   trade  +250.00  month  +550.00  high   550.00  -> keep trading
   trade  -200.00  month  +350.00  high   550.00  -> keep trading
   trade  +300.00  month  +650.00  high   650.00  -> keep trading
   trade  -400.00  month  +250.00  high   650.00  -> keep trading
   trade  -119.00  month  +131.00  high   650.00  -> keep trading
   trade    -2.00  month  +129.00  high   650.00  -> STOP for the month
   new month -> trading again
3) Restart the loss recovery on the 1st (Crooks C)
   Oct: base trade risk 50.00 lost, owed 50.00
   Oct: base trade risk 50.00 won, owed 20.00, next risk 50.00 (recovery)
   1 Nov: restart done, owed 0.00, next risk 50.00
   restart off: next month restart not done, owed 50.00 (kept)
4) Trades booked by the EA (BookClosed) count in the month: lock $150
   trade closed +80.00 (risk 50.00) -> keep trading
   trade closed +80.00 (risk 50.00) -> STOP for the month
